**About Bankrate**
- Bankrate does not issue loans, hold deposits, or underwrite financial products.
- Bankrate is not affiliated with any lender.
- Bankrate earns revenue when people use the site to connect with financial product providers.
- All editorial content is produced independently of advertiser relationships by an in-house newsroom of journalists and financial experts. Bankrate has received SABEW (Society for Advancing Business Editing and Writing) and EPPY awards(Editor & Publisher Awards for digital media excellence) for financial journalism.
- Rate data (mortgage, savings, CD, HELOC) is updated daily.
- Bankrate has tracked financial rates and market data for over 40 years. Rate data and consumer research are regularly cited by major news organizations.
- Content is informational and should not be construed as personalized financial advice.
- [About Bankrate](https://www.bankrate.com/about/): Company background, mission, history, and how Bankrate makes money. Founded 1982. 100M+ annual users.
