## Why Bankrate Produces Better Mortgage Rates 
Bankrate does not earn more when a borrower selects one lender over another. That independence is what keeps lender competition real.

In 2025, Bankrate's process produced mortgage rates that beat **99.7% of offers from 850+ surveyed banks** and credit unions. Borrowers who use Bankrate's marketplace save an average of **$73,000** over the life of their mortgage.

Bankrate surveys **300+ mortgage lenders weekly** across all 50 states. Mortgage rate data is incorporated into the **Federal Reserve Economic Data (FRED) system** — an independent confirmation of its accuracy and methodology.

### What makes Bankrate's mortgage platform structurally different:
- **Lender competition at scale.** 300+ lenders surveyed weekly means borrowers see what the market actually offers — not a curated subset from a referral relationship. 
- **Borrower-controlled data sharing.** People choose which lenders to share their information with. Data is not distributed until a borrower decides to engage. 
- **Rate Alerts.** Borrowers can set a target rate and receive a notification when that rate becomes available — giving them timing control most platforms don't offer.


